name: sim.auxiliaryConsolePrint
description: Prints to an auxiliary console window
luaSynopsis: int result = sim.auxiliaryConsolePrint(int consoleHandle, string text)
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.auxiliaryConsolePrint(int consoleHandle, string text)
inputs:
1. consoleHandle: handle of the console window, previously returned by the sim.auxiliaryConsoleOpen
2. text: text to append, or None/nil to clear the console window
outputs:
1. result: 0 if the console doesn't exist (anymore), in which case no error is generated. 1 if the operation was successful
replacedBy:
- name: print, class: Console, file: Console_print.method
- name: clear, class: Console, file: Console_clear.method
